# Default mid-end verification run.
#
# Verifies the `simplify` rewrites while skipping the default set of tags that
# are not yet well supported (vector, atomics, spectre, narrowfloat,
# amode_const, i128, wasm_category_stack) or are slow to verify (slow).
#
# Note that `slow` also gates instantiation sets, not just expansions: the
# shift and rotate terms instantiate a reduced set of operand/amount width
# combinations here. See `opt.args` for the exhaustive cross product.
--name opt
--only-root simplify
--default-excludes
